prayers:Sep 21 11:13:18 :: Prayer: &03Mobius prays, 'Arbaces, are you there Great One? =p'&00
prayers:Dec 18 01:57:50 :: Prayer: &03Aidyn prays, 'Arbaces :('&00
prayers:Dec 18 03:01:14 :: Prayer: &03Aillen prays, 'Arbaces pretend I said, whatever it is that will piss you off to deleting khan.'&00
prayers:Dec 26 23:46:45 :: Prayer: &03Gangrel prays, 'Arbaces, may I have an audience with you to discuss the suspected duping of EQ?'&00
prayers:Dec 30 20:23:48 :: Prayer: &03Mobius prays, 'Arbaces up there?'&00
prayers:Feb 16 20:11:52 :: Prayer: &03Aptos prays, 'is Arbaces available for a short word?'&00
prayers:Mar  4 21:19:29 :: Prayer: &03Aptos prays, 'Arbaces are you available for a minute'&00
prayers:Jul 11 19:47:01 :: Prayer: &03Dhanize prays, 'Almighty Arbaces of the Higlanders, As I take the life of Drogo and honor you with its ceremony, thou request to beseech thee be granted of me.'&00
prayers:Jul 17 17:29:23 :: Prayer: &03Krank prays, 'Arbaces, got a minute?'&00
prayers:Jan 23 06:54:16 :: Prayer: &03Karias prays, 'Arbaces And on a side note, I understand your time is very limited, thanks for dedicating what you can here. If you're looking for coders let me know, I know a few hidden "coders" that mud here who would help.'&00
prayers:Feb  3 17:50:20 :: Prayer: &03Karias prays, 'Arbaces, you got mudmail'&00
